                <!-- Docker Features Info Box -->
                <mxCell id="dockerinfo" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Docker Architecture Features:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• All services containerized except Indexer&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• Bridge network for internal communication&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• Service discovery via container names&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• Database sharding with volume mounts&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• Health monitoring and dependency management&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• Scalable architecture with load balancing&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Volume Details:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• Both SearchAPI containers mount the same host directory&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• Shared access to database shard files&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• Read-only access from containers&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• Indexer writes directly to host directory&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Images:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• searchengine-searchweb:latest&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• searchengine-loadbalancer:latest&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• searchengine-searchapi:latest&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;• searchengine-consolesearch:latest&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e6f3ff;strokeColor=#4d94ff;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
